@startuml Data Flow Diagram

title ActivityPub Data Flow

actor User
participant "Web Client" as Client
participant "ActivityPub Core" as Core
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Remote Server" as Remote

== User Action ==
Client -> Core: POST /inbox
Core -> Core: Validate Signature
Core -> Core: Process Activity
Core -> DB: Save Activity
DB --> Core: Confirmation
Core --> Client: 202 Accepted

== Remote Federation ==
Remote -> Core: GET /.well-known/webfinger
Core -> Core: Resolve Actor
Core --> Remote: WebFinger Response

Remote -> Core: POST /inbox
Core -> Core: Verify Signature
Core -> Core: Store Activity
Core -> DB: Save Activity
DB --> Core: Saved
Core --> Remote: 200 OK

== Outbound Activity ==
Core -> Core: Create Activity
Core -> Remote: POST Activity
Remote --> Core: 200 OK

@enduml
